# Panther Pounce: "Target player investigates. Target creature gets +1/+0 and gains flying until end of turn. Untap it." With two
# targets, the spell is countered on resolution only if all its targets are illegal (CR 608.2b): Bot1 casts it on turn 3 at Bot2 and at
# its own Ornithopter, and Bot2 kills the Ornithopter in response with Lightning Bolt. The player target is still legal, so Bot2
# still investigates - a Clue under Bot2's control - and the creature's part does nothing.

